    t=para(t,'Profit factorial interactions are','Profit factorial interactions are '+sl([r['factorial']/1000 for r in A['reference'] if r['objective']=='profit'])+r' thousand CNY/day. Shapley values split the joint gain over instrument orders and already include the interaction; the waterfall therefore uses standalone effects. WC joint control selects '+str(op[1]['tier_departures'][0])+r' G departures against 136 observed. Pricing, occupancy and consolidation interact through the binding seat constraint. Table~\ref{tab:baseline_policy_values} gives the matched operations and traveler outcomes.')
    broad=D['broad'];infeasible=sum(any(r['meta'].get('infeasibility_certificate') for r in g['records'] if r['policy']=='P4') for g in groups('E7'));t=para(t,'The broader domain crosses','The broader domain crosses five polarization scales and road intensities 0, 0.25, 0.50, 1.00 and 1.50 under the absolute floor. P0 is feasible in '+str(sum(r['P0_feasible'] for r in broad))+' of 75 states; P3/P4 have paired feasible designs in '+sl([sum(r[p+'_feasible'] for r in broad) for p in ['P3','P4']],0)+' states. The single-OD master proves P4 infeasibility in '+str(infeasible)+r' states. The archive distinguishes these certificates from unresolved searches, and Table~\ref{tab:experiment_overview} separates P0 violation types.')
