    lead='A strict reference participation floor acts as an indirect fare restraint. Mean commercial G/D multipliers fall from '+sl([r['commercial_fare'] for r in sr],3)+' to '+sl([r['strict_fare'] for r in sr],3)+'. The constrained designs restore '+sl([100*r['traveler_surplus_recovery'] for r in sr])+' percent of the central commercial traveler-surplus loss. Welfare above P0 is '+sl([r['welfare_gain']/1000 for r in sr])+' thousand CNY/day. HN/WC attain '+sl([100*r['benchmark_fraction'] for r in sr[:2]])+' percent of their certified reference P3 welfare benchmarks and retain '+sl([100*r['profit_retained'] for r in sr[:2]])+' percent of central profit gains. JX attains '+f(100*sr[2]['benchmark_fraction'])+' percent of its reference welfare witness. HN/WC strict-floor profit designs are certified with hard finance and retention.'
    change='Raising the floor from 0.95 to 1.00 reduces profit by '+sl([-r['profit_change']/1000 for r in fl])+' thousand CNY/day, restores '+sl([r['restored'] for r in fl],2)+' L trips and changes departures by '+sl([r['net_departures'] for r in fl],0)+'. Traveler-surplus gains are '+sl([r['U_change']/1000 for r in fl])+', and welfare gains above the corresponding commercial designs are '+sl([r['welfare_change']/1000 for r in fl])+r' thousand CNY/day. Table~\ref{tab:governance_robustness} separates changes from levels above P0.';t=para(t,'Raising the absolute reference retention floor',lead+'\n\n'+change)
