    new+='At the central elasticity, tightening the cap from 1.20 to 1.10 cuts commercial welfare losses by '+sl([100*r['welfare_loss_reduction'] for r in cap])+' percent, retaining '+sl([100*r['profit_retained'] for r in cap])+r' percent of central profit gains. Welfare remains '+sl([abs(r['W_change'])/1000 for r in cap])+r' thousand CNY/day below P0. Strict HN/WC floor 1.00 instead yields positive welfare gains of '+sl([r['welfare_gain']/1000 for r in sr[:2]])+' thousand CNY/day, retaining '+sl([100*r['profit_retained'] for r in sr[:2]])+r' percent of central profit gains. Table~\ref{tab:governance_robustness}D compares both levers against the same commercial benchmark.'+'\n\n'
